Theorem audit
  For every self-converse class through n=6:
  * |Anti(T)|=|Aut(T)|.
  * every anti-automorphism induces the same map on Aut(T)-vertex orbits.
  * that rooted-perspective map is an involution.
  Individual vertex cycles are not canonical; the perspective involution is.

