Assumption challenge
  Vertices used above were proof routes and carrier obligations, not points.
  Alternate vertices considered: tournament vertices, rooted perspectives,
  anti-automorphism coset elements, unit spines, unit-edge packets,
  Eisenstein shells, Moser slabs, and forbidden-H proof obligations.
  The chosen quotient preserves the SC flip payload and the H-gap guardrail;
  it destroys continuous embeddings and raw point coordinates.
